        <p>When yin are distressed by a mis,rable cold, nose bunged up, threat sore, limbs aching, with a generil feelinz of smothering, a few d ,ses of the Balsom of Honey will clear the wretched symptons away almost before you know it, There is nothing lkie it on the market; it is thoroughly up to date : it triOkles into all the system. A true friend, prompt and reliable in its action. JUST ANOTHER WORD.</p>
